[00:00.00] 
[00:01.25]Tetsu no tama ga seigi no shoumei
[00:04.07]Tsuranukeba eiyuu ni chikazuita
[00:06.82]Sono me wo tojite furete mireba
[00:09.34]Onaji katachi onaji taion no akuma
[00:14.37] 
[00:14.95]Boku wa dame de aitsu wa ii no?
[00:17.38]Soko ni kabe ga atta dake na no ni
[00:20.08]Umarete shimatta sadame nageku na
[00:22.70]Bokura wa minna jiyuu nan dakara
[00:26.51]Tori no you ni hane ga areba
[00:31.79]Doko e datte yukeru kedo
[00:37.20]Kaeru basho ga nakereba
[00:41.27]Kitto doko e mo yukenai
[00:46.77]Tadatada ikiru no wa iya da
[00:51.98]Sekai wa zankoku da sore demo kimi wo aisu yo
[01:02.35]Nani wo gisei ni shitemo sore demo kimi wo mamoru yo
[01:12.90]Machigai da to shitemo utagattari shinai
[01:18.04]Tadashisa to wa jibun no koto tsuyoku shinjiru koto da
[01:24.59] 
[01:33.64]Tetsu no ame ga furi chiru joukei
[01:36.01]Terebi no naka eiga ni mietan da
[01:38.76]Sensou nante oroka na kyoubou
[01:41.34]Kankei nai shiranai kuni no hanashi
[01:44.09]Sore nara nande aitsu nikunde
[01:46.57]Kuroi kimochi kakushi kirenai wake
[01:49.36]Setsumei datte deki ya shinain da
[01:51.91]Bokura wa nante mujun bakka nan da
[01:58.21] 
[02:17.53]Kono kotoba mo yakusarereba
[02:22.44]Hontou no imi wa tsutawaranai
[02:27.75]Shinjiru no wa sono me wo hiraite
[02:33.36]Fureta sekai dake
[02:37.34]Tadatada ikiru no wa iya da
[02:45.18]Sekai wa zankoku da sore demo kimi wo aisu yo
[02:56.44]Nani wo gisei ni shitemo sore demo kimi wo mamoru yo
[03:06.50]Eranda hito no kage suteta mono no shikabane
[03:11.83]Kizuitan da jibun no naka sodatsu no wa akuma no ko
[03:17.29]Seigi no ura gisei no naka kokoro ni wa akuma no ko
